https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/legacy_drupal_files/omb/circulars/A4/a-4.pdf
), in Tables 138 through 140 (Accounting Statements), we have prepared an accounting statement. This estimate includes growth in incurred benefits from CY 2023 to CY 2024 based on the FY 2024 President's Budget baseline.

